message: "If you use this repository in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "ContextDroid: Reproducible Dynamic Android Behavior Dataset Pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Agbaria"
    given-names: "Hasan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hasansaad1/ContextDroid"
url: "https://github.com/hasansaad1/ContextDroid"
license: "MIT"
version: "v0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-01"
abstract: >
  ContextDroid is a public, reproducible pipeline for generating dynamic Android
  behavior artifacts from benign APKs in an emulator sandbox using Frida, strace,
  and controlled UI stimulation, with traceability-focused metadata and dataset indexing.
keywords:
  - android
  - malware-analysis
  - dynamic-analysis
  - frida
  - reproducibility
